@startuml ARCH-02c-客户端组合架构课堂简图
' 课堂汇报简图，来源：ARCH-02a-客户端逻辑分层图.puml
title 客户端：分层架构 + 端口/适配器 + 本地优先
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction

component "表现与交互层\nAndroid / Windows 原生界面\n阅读、选区、同意、冲突提示" as UI #E1F5FE
component "应用编排层\n导入与版本识别\n检索、问答与同步编排" as App #F1F8E9
component "领域与合同层\nDocumentVersion / Citation\nSyncOperation / 证据合同" as Domain #FFF3CD
component "平台适配层\n文件、文档、OCR\n数据库、安全存储、持久任务" as Adapter #EDE7F6

database "端侧本地数据\n原文、解析结果、全文与向量索引、笔记" as Local #ECEFF1

UI -right-> App
App -down-> Domain
Domain -right-> Adapter : 端口
Adapter -down-> Local

note bottom of Domain
文档解析、OCR、索引和证据选择主要在客户端完成。
end note
@enduml
